# Native build products only. `ios/` and `android/` themselves are committed
# (D57): they carry the Xcode and Gradle projects, the signing settings and the
# icon catalogues, so the owner's first build is open-and-sign rather than
# generate-then-sign. Each one also ships its own .gitignore for the rest of the
# noise — the synced copy of `dist/`, the generated capacitor.config.json,
# xcuserdata, `.gradle/`, `local.properties`. The lines below are belt and
# braces on top of those, and every one of them is a build product.
ios/App/Pods/
ios/App/build/
ios/App/output/
DerivedData/
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties
android/.idea/
